### RESTful 연습 — IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 로 실행
### 위에서부터 순서대로 실행해 보세요. (서버: ./gradlew bootRun)

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. POST — 생성 (201 Created + Location 헤더)
POST {{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "keyboard", "price": 30000 }

### 2. POST — 하나 더
POST {{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "mouse", "price": 15000 }

### 3. GET — 목록 (200)
GET {{host}}/items

### 4. GET — 단건 (200)
GET {{host}}/items/1

### 5. GET — 없는 id (404)
GET {{host}}/items/999

### 6. PUT — 전체 교체 (모든 필드 필수)
PUT {{host}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "mechanical keyboard", "price": 89000 }

### 7. PUT — 필드 누락 시 (400)
PUT {{host}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "" , "price": -1 }

### 8. PATCH — 일부만 수정 (price만 바뀜)
PATCH {{host}}/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 79000 }

### 9. DELETE — 삭제 (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/items/2

### 10. DELETE — 이미 삭제됨 (404)
DELETE {{host}}/items/2
